{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type StructuredOutputPart<TData> = \n  | StructuredOutputPartBase<TData> & object\n  | StructuredOutputPartBase<TData> & object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L534","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:534"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"StructuredOutputPart — a typed structured response attached to the assistant\nmessage that produced it. Generic over the schema-inferred data type so\nconsumers can thread "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useChat({ outputSchema })"},{"type":"text","value":"'s schema all the way down\nto "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"messages[i].parts[j].data"},{"type":"text","value":". Defaults to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":" so untyped consumers\n(e.g. internal codepaths that don't know about TSchema) keep working."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Discriminated on "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"status"},{"type":"text","value":": checking "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"status === 'complete'"},{"type":"text","value":" narrows "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":"\nto "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype StructuredOutputPart<TData> = \n  | StructuredOutputPartBase<TData> & object\n  | StructuredOutputPartBase<TData> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:534](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L534)\n\nStructuredOutputPart — a typed structured response attached to the assistant\nmessage that produced it. Generic over the schema-inferred data type so\nconsumers can thread `useChat({ outputSchema })`'s schema all the way down\nto `messages[i].parts[j].data`. Defaults to `unknown` so untyped consumers\n(e.g. internal codepaths that don't know about TSchema) keep working.\n\nDiscriminated on `status`: checking `status === 'complete'` narrows `data`\nto `TData`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: StructuredOutputPart\ntitle: StructuredOutputPart\n---\n\n```ts\ntype StructuredOutputPart<TData> = \n  | StructuredOutputPartBase<TData> & object\n  | StructuredOutputPartBase<TData> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:534](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L534)\n\nStructuredOutputPart — a typed structured response attached to the assistant\nmessage that produced it. Generic over the schema-inferred data type so\nconsumers can thread `useChat({ outputSchema })`'s schema all the way down\nto `messages[i].parts[j].data`. Defaults to `unknown` so untyped consumers\n(e.g. internal codepaths that don't know about TSchema) keep working.\n\nDiscriminated on `status`: checking `status === 'complete'` narrows `data`\nto `TData`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n"}
